        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.239,
            0.848,
            0.294
          ],
          "content": "4. You are told that 1331 is a perfect cube. Can you guess without factorisation what its cube root is? Similarly, guess the cube roots of 4913, 12167, and 32768."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.301,
            0.313,
            0.32
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** Yes it is 11."
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.325,
            0.675,
            0.346
          ],
          "content": "\\sqrt{1331}=11,\\sqrt{4913}=17,\\sqrt{12167}=23,\\sqrt{32768}=32",
          "image_source": "images/page_21_equation_8.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.352,
            0.533,
            0.373
          ],
          "content": "Use your own strategies to guess."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.394,
            0.276,
            0.413
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Page No. 17"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.434,
            0.784,
            0.455
          ],
          "content": "5. Which of the following is the greatest? Explain your reasoning."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.456,
            0.739,
            0.478
          ],
          "content": "(i) $6 7 ^ { 3 } - 6 6 ^ { 3 }$ (ii) $4 3 ^ { 3 }   -   4 2 ^ { 3 }$ (iii) $6 7 ^ { 2 }   -   6 6 ^ { 2 }$ (iv) $4 3 ^ { 2 }   \\stackrel { \\triangledown } { - }   4 2 ^ { 2 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.483,
            0.46,
            0.505
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** (i) $6 7 ^ { 3 } - 6 6 ^ { 3 }$ is the greatest."
        },
